  {"text":"Hal, has Dad a flag?","letters":"adfghls","d":2,"theme":"home-row","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"The fish are biting.","letters":"abefghinrst","d":1,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"Hold the line!","letters":"dehilnot","d":1,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"Is that a shark?","letters":"ahikrst","d":1,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"The water is cold.","letters":"acdehilorstw","d":1,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"I see a fin!","letters":"aefins","d":1,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"Cast it out there.","letters":"acehiorstu","d":1,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"What was that?","letters":"ahstw","d":1,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"Reel it in slow.","letters":"eilnorstw","d":1,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"Here it comes!","letters":"cehimorst","d":1,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"The tide is high.","letters":"deghist","d":1,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"Grab the net, quick!","letters":"abceghiknqrtu","d":2,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"The sun is up, and the fish are hungry.","letters":"adefghinprstuy","d":2,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"Steady now, keep the line tight!","letters":"adeghiklnopstwy","d":2,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"Did you see the size of that one?","letters":"adefhinostuyz","d":2,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"The tide is turning, so we should move.","letters":"deghilmnorstuvw","d":2,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"Is the bait still on the hook?","letters":"abehiklnost","d":2,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"Something big is down there, I can feel it.","letters":"abcdefghilmnorstw","d":2,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"The marlin ran hard, but the line held.","letters":"abdehilmnrtu","d":3,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"We fished all morning, and caught nothing at all.","letters":"acdefghilmnorstuw","d":3,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"Look at the birds diving, that means fish below!","letters":"abdefghiklmnorstvw","d":3,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"Keep the rod tip up, and let him tire himself out.","letters":"adefhiklmnoprstu","d":3,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"The water went quiet, and then the reel started screaming.","letters":"acdeghilmnqrstuw","d":3,"theme":"fishing","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"The old muskie circled once, and dove.","letters":"acdehiklmnorstuv","d":4,"theme":"the-legend","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"After ten thousand casts, the legend took the bait!","letters":"abcdefghiklnorstu","d":4,"theme":"the-legend","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"He ran for deep water, then turned back.","letters":"abcdefhknoprtuw","d":4,"theme":"the-legend","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"Every angler here has a story about that fish.","letters":"abefghilnorstuvy","d":4,"theme":"the-legend","location":"ocean"},
  {"text":"The reel screamed, and the old rod bent double.","letters":"abcdehlmnorstu","d":4,"theme":"the-legend","location":"ocean"}
